{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99778","id":2204785790,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Dalx-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99778","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99778.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99778.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99778","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99778/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99778/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99778/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2d96fc5ce034ec14d6b137a82f75e60b42d2a1db","number":99778,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add support for immutable variables","user":{"login":"JackErb","id":16454787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDU0Nzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16454787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb","html_url":"https://github.com/JackErb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackErb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add support for immutable variable using the `let` qualifier in GDScript. This variable must be assigned a value at the declaration site. It can never be modified after the initial assignment.\r\n\r\nNote that immutability differs from `const` as it can be applied to any runtime variable, whereas `const` requires that the expression be resolved at compile-time.\r\n\r\nImplements and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/820_\r\n\r\nThis works in the following contexts:\r\n1. local variables.\r\n    * `let value = 10.0`\r\n2. function parameters\r\n    * add optional `let` in function signature to make immutable\r\n    * `func foo(let bar: float)`\r\n3. class level variables\r\n    * works for static variables\r\n    * works with @onready\r\n    * `@onready let parent = $\"..\"`\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec133963-0aed-4db8-b0f5-b4ba9887cd36).\r\n\r\n=====\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Reach consensus on syntax.\r\n- [ ] Explore where immutability should be checked at runtime. In the VM, or in `GDScriptInstance::set()`?\r\n- [ ] Condense the tests into shared files.\r\n\r\nFUTURE TODO (not in the scope of this change):\r\n- Would be nice to not require an initial assignment at the declaration site, but still guarantee it is set only one time.\r\n     * e.g. could be set individually in each branch of a match statement\r\n     * e.g. could be set once in the constructor or ready()\r\n     * Both these cases would throw an error if we attempt to access the value before it is assigned.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"h